"text":"Weyob sogosulid: “Anse galakusye.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Ar andi, be-sabgued-dummarba-nikadgi bensulid.","poem":1},{"text":"Be-an-abonogedgi an weligwar itoged.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Bab-Jehováʼye, an bega namaked,","poem":1},{"text":"Be nued-angi-binsamaidba, an bega namaked.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/PSA/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}